ic, 8k, 9:16 aspect ratio, no timecode, no subtitles.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜3\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"Extreme Close-up, Empress face covered in heavy sweat, intense agony, dark palace, Chinese historical drama, highly detailed skin, 8k, 9:16 aspect ratio, no timecode, no subtitles.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜4\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"Close-up, silk blanket on bed soaked with deep red blood, dramatic shadows, Chinese historical drama, classical aesthetic, ultra-realistic, 8k, 9:16 aspect ratio, no timecode, no subtitles.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜5\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"Medium Shot, royal doctor in green robe kneeling down, anxious expression, dark palace, Chinese historical drama, cinematic lighting, ultra-realistic, 8k, 9:16 aspect ratio, no timecode, no subtitles.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜6\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"Medium Shot, maid in light green dress running frantically out of palace, dynamic motion, Chinese historical drama, cinematic lighting, 8k, 9:16 aspect ratio, no timecode, no subtitles.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜7\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"Close-up, maid holding Empress hands tightly, extremely worried expression, dark background, Chinese historical drama, ancient palace aesthetic, realistic 8k, 9:16 aspect ratio, no timecode, no subtitles.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜8\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"Medium Shot, maid walking in hurriedly, holding an ornate brocade box carefully, Chinese historical drama, ancient palace aesthetic, realistic 8k, 9:16 aspect ratio, no timecode, no subtitles.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜9\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"Close-up, maid with surprised joyful expression, presenting the medicinal box, dramatic lighting, Chinese historical drama, classical aesthetic, realistic 8k, 9:16 aspect ratio, no timecode, no subtitles.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "nam